<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Courier Co offers same-day delivery, scheduled courier support, business transport, and interactive quote planning.">
    <title>Courier Co | Reliable Courier & Logistics</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon-32x32.png">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="navbar">
        <div class="site-title">
            <a href="/">Courier Co</a>
        </div>

        <input type="checkbox" id="menu-checkbox" hidden>
        <label for="menu-checkbox" class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</label>

        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about">About Us</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services">Services</a></li>
                <li><a href="/enquiries">Enquiries &amp; Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <p class="eyebrow">Fast, flexible, dependable logistics</p>
                <h1>Courier and logistics support built around urgent deliveries and business needs.</h1>
                <p>
                    Courier Co provides same-day, scheduled, and business delivery services for customers who need
                    a reliable partner for parcels, documents, and regular transport jobs.
                </p>
                <p>
                    This upgraded version of the site is designed to support your Project 2 by giving users clearer
                    actions, stronger service information, and a more interactive journey toward getting a quote.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="/services" class="btn">View Services</a>
                    <a href="/enquiries" class="btn btn-secondary">Get a Quote</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-panel">
                <h2>Why customers choose Courier Co</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Same-day support for urgent local jobs</li>
                    <li>Scheduled collections for planned deliveries</li>
                    <li>Business courier services for repeat clients</li>
                    <li>Clear contact routes for fast quote requests</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="trust-bar">
            <div class="trust-item">
                <h2>Same-Day</h2>
                <p>Fast response for urgent deliveries.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="trust-item">
                <h2>Scheduled</h2>
                <p>Pre-booked transport around your timetable.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="trust-item">
                <h2>Business Support</h2>
                <p>Reliable courier help for repeat clients.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-services">
            <h2>Our Key Services</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">
                Explore the main services offered by Courier Co and choose the option that best suits your delivery needs.
            </p>

            <div class="services-grid">
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3>Same-Day Delivery</h3>
                    <p>
                        Fast and dependable same-day courier services for urgent local deliveries where timing matters most.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/services">Learn more</a>
                </article>

                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3>Scheduled Delivery</h3>
                    <p>
                        Flexible pre-booked collections and deliveries designed to work around your day or business timetable.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/services">Learn more</a>
                </article>

                <article class="service-card">
                    <h3>Business Courier</h3>
                    <p>
                        Reliable support for companies needing regular parcel, document, or contract delivery services.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/services">Learn more</a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-steps">
            <h2>How it works</h2>
            <div class="steps-grid">
                <article class="step-card">
                    <span>1</span>
                    <h3>Tell us what you need moved</h3>
                    <p>Share your collection, delivery, and timing requirements.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="step-card">
                    <span>2</span>
                    <h3>Choose the right service</h3>
                    <p>Select same-day, scheduled, or business support based on urgency and job type.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="step-card">
                    <span>3</span>
                    <h3>Request your quote</h3>
                    <p>Use the enquiries page to submit your delivery details and receive a tailored response.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-cta">
            <h2>Need a delivery quote?</h2>
            <p>
                Ready to move from brochure site to interactive service experience. Start by guiding users directly toward
                your quote and enquiry process.
            </p>
            <a href="/enquiries" class="btn">Request a Quote</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://twitter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-center">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Courier Co</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-right">
            <img src="/images/courier-co.jpg" alt="Courier delivery illustration" class="footer-logo">
        </div>

        <div class="footer-credits">
            <p>
                Images courtesy of
                <a href="https://unsplash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash</a>
                and
                <a href="https://www.freepik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Freepik</a>.
                Favicon from
                <a href="https://favicon.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">favicon.io</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>